  <details><summary><span class="dot b"></span><b>CTIN</b> — computers that remit<span class="d">2012–14</span></summary><p>Team Lead on a Bitcoin remittance platform with 5,000+ active users.</p></details>
  <details><summary><span class="dot g"></span><b>Bicimensajero.com</b> — bikes that deliver<span class="d">2014–16</span></summary><p>Founded an on-demand bike courier service. Built the product myself, grew it to 100+ couriers and led the company to an acquisition.</p></details>
  <details><summary><span class="dot y"></span><b>Linio Group</b> — warehouses that merge<span class="d">2019–20</span></summary><p>Group Product Manager. Directed post-M&amp;A systems integration through the Falabella acquisition and unified multi-platform infrastructure.</p></details>
  <details><summary><span class="dot r"></span><b>AB InBev</b> — beer that rewards<span class="d">2020–23</span></summary><p>Global Principal Product Manager. Built the global rewards ecosystem across Central America, Europe and South Korea. Led 70+ people and owned a $70M+ portfolio, with campaigns at the Super Bowl and The Voice Brasil.</p></details>
  <details open><summary><span class="dot k"></span><b>Golden Frijoles</b> &amp; <b>Miyagi Sánchez</b> — agents that ship<span class="new">NEW</span><span class="d">2025–now</span></summary><p>Founder &amp; Product Lead on two products in production. <a href="{{ d.links.goldenfrijoles.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Golden Frijoles</a> is an agentic product-management platform (87 initiatives shipped in the open). <a href="https://miyagisanchez.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Miyagi Sánchez</a> is prompt-to-shop e-commerce infrastructure for Mexico (147 initiatives shipped).</p></details>
  <div class="fire"><span class="sp" data-s="flame" data-z="4"></span>MY ROADMAP IS ON FIRE<span class="sp" data-s="flame" data-z="4"></span></div>
 </div></section>

